{"title":"Dire Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (3.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>41</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>53</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>46</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>41</td><td>in the wilds around 933, 43</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>53</td><td>in the wilds around 927, 48</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>46</td><td>in the wilds around 1031, -22</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>25</td><td>in the wilds around 1030, -34</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dire-wolf\" data-map-level=\"21\">Show level 21 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 3 of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wolf-pelt\" title=\"Wolf Pelt - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 13 total, 13 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a24a0ceb9eeabaa06889.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×13</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 3 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"bones\" title=\"Bones - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Wolfden</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 6</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-120\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n    